<title>SINGAPORE: Vicom posts smaller 1996/97 net profit.</title>
<headline>Vicom posts smaller 1996/97 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			 (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   2.05    vs     3.36</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)		    11.0     vs     5.0</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  2.6     vs     4.8 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     7.19    vs     7.68</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest    0.72    vs     0.46</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	   1.23    vs     0.64</p>
<p>    Income from associates  (loss) 0.11    vs     nil</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     2.91    vs     4.57</p>
<p>    Tax				    0.92    vs     1.21</p>
<p>    Minorities			   0.17    vs     0.00</p>
<p>Note - Vicom Ltd is involved in motor vehicle inspection and related services.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
